ed invoice INV-26417 by wire for $1,785.41. The payment ID is PAY0001 and its status is \"sent\".\n\nAcme's vendor record lists wire and ACH as available and bank-verified, so I didn't need the ACH fallback. The amount is under the $10,000 controller-approval threshold, so no extra approval was needed. I sent the payment once, with an idempotency key so a retry can't pay it twice.\n\nAcme has two other invoices that I left alone: INV-10196 ($5,826.95) is still a draft awaiting approval, and INV-68412 ($7,475.56) is already marked paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}